IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BANKTRANSACTION.
AUTHOR. JABEZ BHARATH SAMUEL P.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-TRAN-ID PIC 9(5).
01 WS-AMOUNT  PIC 9(6).
01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(7) VALUE 50000.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER TRANSACTION ID: ".
    ACCEPT WS-TRAN-ID.

    DISPLAY "ENTER TRANSACTION AMOUNT: ".
    ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT.

    IF WS-AMOUNT > 0 AND WS-AMOUNT <= WS-BALANCE

        SUBTRACT WS-AMOUNT FROM WS-BALANCE

        DISPLAY "TRANSACTION SUCCESSFUL"
        DISPLAY "TRANSACTION ID: " WS-TRAN-ID
        DISPLAY "REMAINING BALANCE: " WS-BALANCE

    ELSE

        DISPLAY "TRANSACTION FAILED"
        DISPLAY "INSUFFICIENT BALANCE OR INVALID AMOUNT"

    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
